      "message": "The call to `bq257x0_set_option_reg` within `write_reg` can fail, but its error code is currently ignored. If the register write fails, `pre_battery_cells` is still updated, which would prevent the code from attempting to set the correct values again until the battery is swapped.\n\nTo make this more robust, `set_chg_reg_custom` should return an error on failure, and `pre_battery_cells` should only be updated if the registers were written successfully.",
